Package: deepines-todo
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libdtkwidget5
Description: ToDo App of the deepin community in Spanish
 Simple and elegant todo list application for Deepin Desktop.
 Features:
  * Create, edit, and delete tasks
  * Mark tasks as completed
  * Drag & drop to reorder
  * Search and filter
  * In-place renaming with double-click
  * Undo delete
  * Statistics and progress bar
  * Export/import to JSON
  * Persistent storage across sessions
